  "明细表中有 {count} 个同名列「{name}」，请改名后再映射": { en: "The detail table has {count} columns named “{name}”. Rename them before mapping.", "zh-Hant": "明細表中有 {count} 個同名列「{name}」，請改名後再映射" },
