  "「{name}」不是表格文件，不能按行/按组切分样本": { en: "“{name}” is not a spreadsheet file, so it cannot be split into samples by row or by group.", "zh-Hant": "「{name}」不是表格文件，不能按行/按組切分樣本" },
  "{count} 个编号在多个文件中重复出现（如 {ids}），它们各自作为独立样本生成，不会合并或去重": { en: { one: "{count} ID appears in more than one file ({ids}). Each occurrence is generated as a separate sample; they are not merged or de-duplicated.", other: "{count} IDs appear in more than one file (such as {ids}). Each occurrence is generated as a separate sample; they are not merged or de-duplicated." }, "zh-Hant": "{count} 個編號在多個文件中重複出現（如 {ids}），它們各自作為獨立樣本產生，不會合併或去重" },
  "{count} 个分组编号在多个文件中出现（如 {ids}），默认按文件分别成组、不会合并；如需跨文件合并请开启「跨文件按编号分组」": { en: { one: "{count} group ID appears in more than one file ({ids}). By default each file forms its own groups, which are not merged; to merge them, turn on “Merge groups across files by key”.", other: "{count} group IDs appear in more than one file (such as {ids}). By default each file forms its own groups, which are not merged; to merge them, turn on “Merge groups across files by key”." }, "zh-Hant": "{count} 個分組編號在多個文件中出現（如 {ids}），預設按文件分別成組、不會合併；如需跨文件合併請開啟「跨文件按編號分組」" },
  "已开启跨文件分组：{count} 个分组的数据来自多个文件并已合并，请在样本清单中核对": { en: { one: "Grouping across files is on: the data of {count} group comes from several files and was merged. Check it in the sample list.", other: "Grouping across files is on: the data of {count} groups comes from several files and was merged. Check them in the sample list." }, "zh-Hant": "已開啟跨文件分組：{count} 個分組的資料來自多個文件並已合併，請在樣本清單中核對" },
